  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Divergent Fist — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>At 3rd level, your lack of an innate technique has caused you to make up for it with pure martial prowess. Once per round, you can use one of the following abilities:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Manji Kick:</strong> As part of an unarmed strike, drop your knees and rotate your body down to give a massive kick in your opponent's face. On a hit, the opponent must make a Constitution saving throw (DC 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength or Dexterity modifier). On a failure, the creature will be stunned until the beginning of their next turn and take twice as much bludgeoning damage from the attack.   </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>One-Two:</strong> As a bonus action, you land a One-Two combo. Make two unarmed attacks. The first damage roll doesn’t add your ability modifier, but on a hit the second gains advantage. The second attack adds three times your Strength or Dexterity modifier to the damage roll if both attacks hit.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Weave:</strong> You enter a defensive stance. You take the dodge action as a reaction instead.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
